          "name": "(Committee and Co-Chairs): Christine Shields, Travis O’Brien, Jonathan Rutz, Allison Collow, Juan Lora,, Paul Ullrich, L. Ruby Leung, F. Martin Ralph, Michael Wehner, Ashley Payne"
        }
      ],
