      "agu:citationCount": 1,
      "agu:reuseCount": 1,
      "description": "The Global Ionospheric Specification is derived from a combination of FORMOSAT-7/COSMIC-2 radio occultation data and GNSS derived TEC data. It consists of electron density on a latitude/longitude/altitude grid at hourly intervals covering the entire globe (not just continental regions).",
      "url": "https://tacc.cwa.gov.tw/data-service/fs7rt_trops/daily_tar/",
      "creator": [
