          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "text": "Heidarzadeh M., Gusman A.R., Ishibe T., Sabeti R., Šepić J., Estimating the eruption-induced water displacement source of the 15 January 2022 Tonga volcanic tsunami from tsunami spectra and numerical…"
