          "agu:sequence": 1
        }
      ],
      "agu:justification": [
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "agu:sequence": 1,
          "text": "This dataset was nominated because education in plasma physics has become more interactive and accessible with this dataset. Browsing the data with the datasets makes the students familiar with the complex in-situ measurements of the Earth environment. Mentors can thus use the dataset to discuss the most complicated case, relying on an almost fully-autonomous process of discovery of our magnetospheric environment."
        }
      ]
