        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "text": "Addor, N., Newman, A. J., Mizukami, N., & Clark, M. P. (2017). The CAMELS data set: Catchment attributes and meteorology for large-sample studies. Hydrology and Earth System Sciences, 21(10),…"
        },
