      "agu:nominatorCount": 1,
      "agu:citationCount": 2,
      "agu:reuseCount": 0,
      "description": "The gridded U.S. anthropogenic methane greenhouse gas inventory (gridded GHGI) includes spatially and temporally resolved (gridded) maps of annual anthropogenic methane emissions (0.1°×0.1°) for the contiguous United States (CONUS). Total gridded methane emissions for each source sector are consistent with national annual U.S. anthropogenic methane emissions reported in the Inventory of U.S. Greenhouse Gas Emissions and Sinks (U.S. GHGI). These data are for the years for 2012-2022 for 34 emissions source categories. Data are presented on an annual basis and, where available for some sources, with monthly scaling factors.",
      "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/16782735",
      "creator": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
