      "name": "Ground-Based Global Navigation Satellite System (GNSS) Hatanaka-compressed Observation Data (1-second sampling, sub-hourly files)",
      "alternateName": "",
      "keywords": {
        "@id": "urn:org:agu:data:impactful-datasets:id:theme:interior"
      },
      "agu:datasetId": "agu-0066",
      "agu:stableKey": "doi:10.5067/gnss/gnss_highrate_d_001|ground-based global navigation satellite system (gnss) hatanaka-compressed observation data (1-second sampling, sub-hourly files)",
      "agu:nominatorCount": 1,
      "agu:citationCount": 1,
      "agu:reuseCount": 0,
      "description": "This dataset consists of ground-based Global Navigation Satellite System (GNSS) Observation Data (1-second sampling, sub-hourly files) from the NASA Crustal Dynamics Data Information System (CDDIS). GNSS provides autonomous geo-spatial positioning with global coverage. GNSS data sets from ground receivers at the CDDIS consist primarily of the data from the U.S. Global Positioning System (GPS) and the Russian GLObal NAvigation Satellite System (GLONASS). Since 2011, the CDDIS GNSS archive includes data from other GNSS (Europe’s Galileo, China’s Beidou, Japan’s Quasi-Zenith Satellite System/QZSS, the Indian Regional Navigation Satellite System/IRNSS, and worldwide Satellite Based Augmentation Systems/SBASs), which are similar to the U.S. GPS in terms of the satellite constellation, orbits, and signal structure. The sub-hourly GNSS observation files (compact) contain 15 minutes of GPS or multi-GNSS observation (1-second sampling) data in RINEX format from a global permanent network of ground-based receivers, one file per 15 minutes per site.",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.5067/GNSS/GNSS_HIGHRATE_D_001",
      "creator": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "@id": "urn:org:agu:data:impactful-datasets:id:person:international-gnss-service-igs",
          "name": "International GNSS Service (IGS)"
        }
      ],
      "agu:curator": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "@id": "urn:org:agu:data:impactful-datasets:id:person:international-gnss-service-igs",
          "name": "International GNSS Service (IGS)"
        }
      ],
      "includedInDataCatalog": {
        "@type": "DataCatalog",
        "@id": "urn:org:agu:data:impactful-datasets:id:organization:cddis",
        "name": "CDDIS"
      },
      "citation": [
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "text": "https://www.mdpi.com/1424-8220/21/21/7374? (references high-rate GNSS data)"
        }
      ],
      "agu:nominator": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "@id": "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9346-1978",
          "name": "Ross Bagwell",
          "affiliation": {
            "@type": "Organization",
            "@id": "urn:org:agu:data:impactful-datasets:id:organization:ssai-nasa-10210-greenbelt-road-suite-600-lanham-md-20706",
            "name": "SSAI/NASA 10210 Greenbelt Road, Suite 600, Lanham, MD 20706"
          },
          "agu:sequence": 1
        }
      ],
      "agu:justification": [
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "agu:sequence": 1,
          "text": "If this dataset were unavailable, it would create significant blind spots across research, operations, and societal applications. People - there would be a loss of high-resolution training data for geodesy, geophysics, and Earth observations in academia, reducing the ability to practice with real, operational datasets - there would be reduced disaster preparedness, losing the ability to detect rapid ground deformations during earthquakes, volcanic eruptions, landslides, etc in near-real time - there would be slower post-event analyses, as emergency managers and researchers would lack second-by-second positioning changes needed to understand event dynamics and improve future warnings - we would have less effective early warning systems, as without sub-second or second-level GNSS signals, such things as tsunami and seismic early warnings would be delayed or less accurate Planet - there…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Dataset",
      "@id": "urn:org:agu:data:impactful-datasets:id:dataset:agu-0067",
      "mainEntityOfPage": "https://impactfuldatasets.agu.org/#/dataset/agu-0067",
      "identifier": [
        {
          "@type": "PropertyValue",
