          "text": "Greene, C. A., Gardner, A. S., & Andrews, L. C. (2020). Detecting seasonal ice dynamics in satellite images. The Cryosphere, 14(12), 4365–4378. https://doi.org/10.5194/tc-14-4365-2020"
        },
