          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "text": "Ma, Y., Wang, Z., Zhang, B., An, J., Geng, H., & Li, F. (2024). The spatiotemporal surface velocity variations and analysis of the amery ice shelf from 2000 to 2022, east antarctica. Remote Sensing,…"
