          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "text": "Angel, Y., Raiho, A., Kathuria, D., Chadwick, K. D., Brodrick, P. G., Lang, E., Ochoa, F., & Shiklomanov, A. N. (2025). Deciphering the spectra of flowers to map landscape‐scale blooming dynamics.…"
