      "agu:justification": [
        {
          "@type": "CreativeWork",
          "agu:sequence": 1,
          "text": "These data provide the ability to examine climate at a global level. It is excellent for all of these dimensions - people, planet and prosperity as each of these are governed by climate at different levels. This dataset is impactful as it is in a format that is easy to use for conducting a analyses related to each of the dimensions (people, planet and prosperity) at a global level. Not only is it available for all to use but they have also documented the creation of the data. Putting this data together is a phenomenal effort and benefits everyone. Climate4all."
        }
      ]
